WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.260
Two people walk past a man
sitting alone outside a station.

2
00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:08.090
The first drops a coin into
his cup and keeps walking.

3
00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:10.660
The second has no money at all.

4
00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:14.580
She stops, smiles, and asks him how he is.

5
00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:16.850
Which of them has given something?

6
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:18.920
Is giving only about money?

7
00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:21.720
So can a smile count as charity?

8
00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:25.020
And what makes Muslim
giving more than a donation?

9
00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:29.040
In this mission, you'll read what the
Qur'an says about giving in secret,

10
00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:30.750
and giving openly.

11
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:34.900
Then you'll see how Muslims organise
their giving to help people in need,

12
00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:36.730
near and far.

13
00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:40.490
Your mission: find out what
counts as charity in Islam,

14
00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:42.030
and why Muslims give.
